    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="28.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 28.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ nan man his men fram him ne tǽce, ær hé clǽne sy æt ælcere spǽce ðe he ær beclypad wæs.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And no-one shall dismiss one of his men from his service until he is quit of every accusation which has been brought against him.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And nan man his men fram him ne tæce, ær he clæne sý ælcere spræce, þe he ær beclypod wæs.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
